(7726942, 1272171, 66597, '<td valign="top">My challenge favorite. I predict blue. Beautiful light, composition, and of course, shutter speed. 10</td>', 'My challenge favorite. I predict blue. Beautiful light, composition, and of course, shutter speed. 10', '2022-08-10 19:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7726944, 1272192, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Lovely piece of art.</td>', 'Beautiful! Lovely piece of art.', '2022-08-10 19:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727848, 1272022, 114285, '<td valign="top">Looks like it has no care in the world. Great stopped action.</td>', 'Looks like it has no care in the world. Great stopped action.', '2022-08-13 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727869, 1272192, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like this, though I wish it wasn''t centered. I think I''d like it a lot more if it pushed the boundaries and was cropped in from the left. (I know, leave space, etc., but it seems like it would add a bit more drama. -7-</td>', 'I really like this, though I wish it wasn''t centered. I think I''d like it a lot more if it pushed the boundaries and was cropped in from the left. (I know, leave space, etc., but it seems like it would add a bit more drama. -7-', '2022-08-14 18:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727870, 1272207, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the crop on the left. I don''t mind a part of a person, but I almost think less of him and leaving his shadow might be more interesting that half.</td>', 'I''m not sure of the crop on the left. I don''t mind a part of a person, but I almost think less of him and leaving his shadow might be more interesting that half.', '2022-08-14 18:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727871, 1272218, 103142, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if I like this or don''t. The blur is making me feel a little sick. But what''s intriguing me is that the red makes it look rather sinister. 6 for now. Might go up</td>', 'I can''t tell if I like this or don''t. The blur is making me feel a little sick. But what''s intriguing me is that the red makes it look rather sinister. 6 for now. Might go up', '2022-08-14 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727872, 1272216, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it fits the challenge very well. Either a slow shutter speed to blur or a fast shutter speed to stop the motion to lead to the main impact. I don''t think the shutter speed really leant much impact to this shot. I''ll come back and look again later, and vote then.</td>', 'I''m not sure it fits the challenge very well. Either a slow shutter speed to blur or a fast shutter speed to stop the motion to lead to the main impact. I don''t think the shutter speed really leant much impact to this shot. I''ll come back and look again later, and vote then.', '2022-08-14 18:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727874, 1272206, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is really quite nice. In a perfect world, I''d almost want the water to be coming from on top, as well. But your water splash is beautifully lit, and your choice of speed definitely makes an impact.</td>', 'This is really quite nice. In a perfect world, I''d almost want the water to be coming from on top, as well. But your water splash is beautifully lit, and your choice of speed definitely makes an impact.', '2022-08-14 18:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727875, 1272075, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like it! I gave the other light a 7, but I like this on better, so I guess it''s an 8. :)</td>', 'I like it! I gave the other light a 7, but I like this on better, so I guess it''s an 8. :)', '2022-08-14 18:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727877, 1272199, 103142, '<td valign="top">The shutter speed definitely makes the impact. Unfortunately, it''s just too busy with all the other geese. It''s too bad you couldn''t have isolated them a bit more. :( -5-</td>', 'The shutter speed definitely makes the impact. Unfortunately, it''s just too busy with all the other geese. It''s too bad you couldn''t have isolated them a bit more. :( -5-', '2022-08-14 18:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727878, 1272213, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is freaky/creepy! Love it! -8-</td>', 'This is freaky/creepy! Love it! -8-', '2022-08-14 18:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7727879, 1272022, 103142, '<td valign="top">Are you sure it''s a catbird? It doesn''t have the dark stripe on the head or the darker tail? And the wings don''t look right...? Nice catch, though! (voting later. Just browsing.) -7-</td>', 'Are you sure it''s a catbird? It doesn''t have the dark stripe on the head or the darker tail? And the wings don''t look right...? Nice catch, though! (voting later. Just browsing.) -7-', '2022-08-14 18:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
